error[DS0001]: unexpected character `#`
  --> query:1:17
  |
1 | t | where x > 1 # comment?
  |                 ^ not valid here
  |
  = help: comments start with `//`

error[DS0001]: unexpected character `?`
  --> query:1:26
  |
1 | t | where x > 1 # comment?
  |                          ^ not valid here
  |
  = help: for a conditional value, use `iff(condition, then, else)`

error[DS0001]: names are not quoted with backticks
  --> query:2:14
  |
2 | | extend y = `z`
  |              ^^^ backticks are not a quote
  |
  = help: quote the name with brackets: `['z']`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
